# render_1: Render One, the map the format and the engine are proven on.
# Two storeys: below, a hall with a spawn and a sign, a door sector (tag
# 1) into a north room with a patrol of waypoints, a spotlight on a
# grate, and the hum ambient, the grate a solid masked wall onto an
# alcove that hums too; a stair of three steps east of the hall to a
# landing under a tall stairwell, then a ramp north up to the upper
# storey. Above, a room over the hall with a window, a solid wall with a
# portal, looking down into the stairwell, and a hall over the north
# room the ramp arrives in. Metres, z up, degrees. The title is the map
# screen's.
